      "customer": {
        "messages": [
          "Amazing! Thank you so much!\nHello! I have a question about the diving excursion. My husband and I are booked for April 13-14 and are staying in the Rosario islands that night. We will be staying at hotel fragata. Will you be able to transport us there?",
          "Amazing thank you! We’re thinking about extending our stay on the Rosario islands. Would it be possible to get dropped back off there after diving on the 14th?",
