          "Just completed the waivers. Thank you!\n[4/11/26, 4:23:01 p.m.] DIVING PLANET CARTAGENA: <adjunto: [REDACTED_PHONE]-STICKER-[REDACTED_PHONE].webp>\nHello. Unfortunately my husband is dealing with food poisoning and experienced the worst of it last night. He is still not feeling great. Is there any possibility we could move our dive to Tuesday-Wednesday by chance? We would both still love to go but we are worried about him diving while being sick. Do we have any options here? Thank you!",
