          "Yes\nPlease\n[4/12/26, 3:38:33 p.m.] DIVING PLANET CARTAGENA: <adjunto: [REDACTED_PHONE]-STICKER-[REDACTED_PHONE].webp>\nThank you so much! We are so excited. I appreciate your help so much\n[4/12/26, 3:40:48 p.m.] DIVING PLANET CARTAGENA: <adjunto: [REDACTED_PHONE]-STICKER-[REDACTED_PHONE].webp>"
