      "diving_planet": {
        "messages": [
          "🇬🇧 Hello! Welcome to Diving Planet, a PADI 5-Star Dive Center! 🌊🤿\nWhether you're a certified diver, a beginner, or a snorkeler, we have the ideal adventure for you. Tell us your level and the experience you're looking for, and we'll be happy to help you plan your adventure.\n🇨🇴 ¡Hola! Bienvenid@ a Diving Planet, un centro de buceo PADI 5 estrellas! 🌊🤿Ya seas buzo certificado, principiante o snorkeler, tenemos la aventura ideal para ti. Cuéntanos cuál es tu nivel y qué experiencia buscas, y con gusto te ayudamos a planificar tu aventura de buceo.",
          "Yes!! No problem at all",
          "Yes",
          "If you take the 2 days (5 dives) you can come back to Cartagena any day…\nYou can also take different plans if you don’t need the transfer to the island Ang back",
          "Let me send you the options",
          "🌊 A 2-day adventure in an underwater paradise leaving from Cartagena ! 🤿\nExplore the best diving in Cartagena with our 5-dive, 2-day package for certified divers — including a night dive, one of the top highlights of the Rosario Islands coral reserve.\nBook now and get a 10% discount 👉\nhttps://divingplanet.org/en/fun-dives-snorkeling-cartagena/5-dives-package-2-days/\n📌 Note: You’ll need to stay at least one night on the islands. Accommodation is not included.\nLet us know if you have any questions! 🐠🪸",
          "🌊 Diving or snorkeling plans from the Rosario Islands 🤿\n🏝️ If you’re already on the islands and don’t need transport or lunch, we have options for certified divers, beginners, and snorkelers:\n✅ Hotel pickup around 9:30 a.m. (if boat access available)\n✅ Dive/snorkel insurance\n✅ Full gear\n✅ Guided experience with a PADI pro\n✅ Return to your hotel around 2:15 p.m.\nCheck out all available plans 👉\nhttps://divingplanet.org/en/scuba-diving-rosario-islands/\nLet us know if you have any questions! 🐠🪸",
          "🇬🇧 Hello! Welcome to Diving Planet, a PADI 5-Star Dive Center! 🌊🤿\nWhether you're a certified diver, a beginner, or a snorkeler, we have the ideal adventure for you. Tell us your level and the experience you're looking for, and we'll be happy to help you plan your adventure.\n🇨🇴 ¡Hola! Bienvenid@ a Diving Planet, un centro de buceo PADI 5 estrellas! 🌊🤿Ya seas buzo certificado, principiante o snorkeler, tenemos la aventura ideal para ti. Cuéntanos cuál es tu nivel y qué experiencia buscas, y con gusto te ayudamos a planificar tu aventura de buceo.\n[4/11/26, 3:55:50 p.m.] DIVING PLANET CARTAGENA: <adjunto: [REDACTED_PHONE]-AUDIO-[REDACTED_PHONE].opus>",
          "🚤 Our meeting point will be “Muelle de la Bodeguita” at 8:00 a.m.\nNo need to wait in line – just ask for DIVING PLANET at Gate 3.\n📍This is the Location: https://tinyurl.com/MuelleDeLaBodeguita\nAny questions? Write to us — we’re here to help! 🌟",
