          "Yes... 🌊 An underwater adventure for beginners! 🤿\nIf you're not certified but want to dive into a fun, exciting, and safe underwater experience, this is the plan for you:\n✅ In the Rosario Islands, a national coral park with the best conditions in the region.\n✅ Always guided by a PADI professional.\n✅ Backed by Colombia’s first PADI 5-Star Dive Center.\nBook now and get a 10% discount 👉\nhttps://divingplanet.org/en/fun-dives-snorkeling-cartagena/minicourses-beginners/\nLet us know if you have any questions! 🐠🪸",
          "You cant book on line because the hour but if you want to come just send me your name and ID number and I book for you manually.",
          "🚤 Our meeting point will be “Marina Todo Mar” at 8:00 a.m.\nHere’s the location to make it easy for you:\n📍 https://tinyurl.com/MarinaTodoMar\nAny questions? Write to us — we’re here to help! 🌟",
          "Thanks for booking your PADI Discover Scuba Diving experience with Diving Planet! 🐠\nTo make sure your experience is exciting, fun, and most importantly, safe, it’s MANDATORY to complete these quick and easy steps before your activity:\n✅ STEPS TO FOLLOW:\n1. Go to the following link: https://learning.padi.com/dsd?store_number=17945\n2. Create your PADI account using your email and a personal password (if you don’t have one yet).\n3. Complete the medical questionnaire.\nThis step is essential to meet PADI safety standards.\n📌 If you’re unsure how to answer any question (especially if it’s a “Yes”), please contact us before continuing. You may need medical clearance to participate.\nMessage us on WhatsApp 📲 [REDACTED_PHONE] or email us at 📩 [REDACTED_EMAIL]\n4. Complete the online Discover Scuba Diving (DSD eLearning).\n5. Once you finish this process, get ready for the adventure:\nYou’ll start with a training session in the pool, where you’ll learn everything you need to dive safely. Then we’ll take you to the ocean for a dive to explore the magical underwater world of the Rosario Islands 🐢🌊 An experience you’ll never forget!\n🎁 As a bonus gift, you’ll receive:\nFREE access to the first part of the Open Water Diver certification course.\nA PADI participation certificate for your Discover Scuba Diving experience.\nThis process is essential to enjoy your training and dive safely in one of the most beautiful marine ecosystems in the Caribbean.\nIf you have any questions, we’re here to help!\nSee you soon underwater!\nBest regards,\nDIVING PLANET TEAM\nPADI Dive Center – Store #17945\n🌐 www.divingplanet.org\n[4/13/26, 6:28:08 p.m.] DIVING PLANET CARTAGENA: <adjunto: [REDACTED_PHONE]-AUDIO-[REDACTED_PHONE].opus>"
